<m-nav title="旅程助手"/>
<view class="page"><view class="title">把零散信息，整理成安排。</view><view class="copy">粘贴行程或订单文字，AI 提取后由你核对，再加入旅程。</view><m-picker range="{{trips}}" range-key="title" bindchange="trip"><view class="picker">{{trip.title || '请先创建旅程'}}　⌄</view></m-picker><textarea class="textarea stack" value="{{text}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="20000" placeholder="在这里粘贴需要整理的资料…"/><view class="copy">点击整理后，这段文字会经微信云函数发送至已配置的模型服务。请先移除身份证号、支付信息等无关内容。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="extract" disabled="{{busy || !ready || !trip || !text}}" loading="{{busy}}">整理成旅程安排</button><view wx:if="{{!ready}}" class="copy">AI 服务暂未启用。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="reviewId" class="card stack"><view class="small">{{item.kind==='transfer'?'交通':item.kind==='stay'?'住宿':item.kind==='activity'?'体验':'片段'}} · {{item.date || '日期待确认'}}</view><view class="result-title">{{item.title || item.from+' → '+item.to}}</view><view class="copy">{{item.body}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="review" data-index="{{index}}">核对并添加</button></view></view>
